<?xml version="1.0" encoding="utf-8"?><fdroid><repo icon="icon.png" name="restoid" pubkey="" timestamp="1794550194" url="https://hddq.github.io/restoid/fdroid/repo" version="20002"><description>Releases published from GitHub tags for restoid.</description></repo><application id="io.github.hddq.restoid"><id>io.github.hddq.restoid</id><added>2026-11-13</added><lastupdated>2026-11-13</lastupdated><name>Restoid - Backup Tool</name><summary>Secure, deduplicated backup for apps and files powered by the restic engine.</summary><desc>Restoid is a modern, privacy-focused backup solution for Android powered by the robust, open-source restic engine. Keep your apps, data, photos, and documents safe with enterprise-grade encryption and lightning-fast, space-saving deduplication.

Whether you want to back up photos to a home NAS, store encrypted snapshots in the cloud, or preserve full app data on a rooted device, Restoid gives you complete control without trackers, ads, or proprietary lock-in.

Root access is completely optional: back up custom folders, photos, and documents without root; root access is only needed to back up private app data.

Key Features:

Blazing Fast &amp; Deduplicated
• Content-Defined Deduplication: Only unique changed blocks are uploaded, making subsequent backups blazingly fast and drastically more efficient than traditional tar.gz archives.
• Space-Saving: Multiple snapshots share common data, keeping storage footprints minimal.

Zero-Knowledge Encryption
• Enterprise security: All snapshots are encrypted with restic using state-of-the-art cryptography.
• Your passwords and encryption keys remain entirely under your control.

Flexible Storage Backends
• Local Storage: Save to internal memory, SD card, or USB OTG drives.
• Network &amp; Cloud: Native support for SFTP (SSH key &amp; password), REST server, and Amazon S3-compatible object storage (Garage, MinIO, Wasabi, Cloudflare R2, Backblaze B2).

Full App &amp; Data Backup (Root Required)
• Selectively back up installed user applications.
• Granular control: Choose whether to include APKs, app data, device-protected data, external files, or OBB caches.

Custom Files &amp; Media
• Back up personal folders: DCIM, Documents, Downloads, or any directory on your device.

Automated Background Schedules
• Configure recurring schedules (daily, weekly, or custom intervals).
• Smart trigger constraints: Run only while charging, on unmetered Wi-Fi, or when battery conditions are met.

Surgical &amp; Safe Restore
• Restore entire apps or specific parts (e.g. restore data without overwriting the installed APK).
• Downgrade protection prevents accidental restoration of older versions over newer ones.

Zero Vendor Lock-in
• Standard restic format: Repositories use the native, open-source restic format. You can always access, inspect, mount, or restore your data on any PC (Linux, macOS, Windows) using the official restic CLI—even without your phone.

Maintenance &amp; Repository Health
• Keep your repository compact with automated snapshot retention policies (prune old backups by day, week, month).
• Run repository integrity checks and clear stale locks with one tap.

Modern Material 3 Expressive UI
• Built with modern Jetpack Compose and Material 3 Expressive design, featuring dynamic theming, smooth animations, and edge-to-edge layout.
• 100% Free and Open Source (GPLv3), with zero analytics, telemetry, or third-party tracking.</desc><license>GPL-3.0-only</license><categories>System</categories><category>System</category><web></web><source>https://github.com/hddq/restoid</source><tracker>https://github.com/hddq/restoid/issues</tracker><author>hddq</author><marketversion></marketversion><marketvercode>282</marketvercode><package><version>0.8.1</version><versioncode>282</versioncode><apkname>app-x86_64-release-v0.8.1.apk</apkname><hash type="sha256">6472894a208e188d79fe4db629a3c99893a976e84f05fa98f5e12a0c956a12f2</hash><size>20458454</size><sdkver>29</sdkver><targetSdkVersion>37</targetSdkVersion><added>2026-11-13</added><sig>f13c464420c712e65cc683706bcc6738</sig><permissions>ACCESS_LOCAL_NETWORK,ACCESS_NETWORK_STATE,ACCESS_WIFI_STATE,FOREGROUND_SERVICE,FOREGROUND_SERVICE_DATA_SYNC,INTERNET,MANAGE_EXTERNAL_STORAGE,POST_NOTIFICATIONS,POST_PROMOTED_NOTIFICATIONS,QUERY_ALL_PACKAGES,READ_EXTERNAL_STORAGE,RECEIVE_BOOT_COMPLETED,REQUEST_IGNORE_BATTERY_OPTIMIZATIONS,USE_BIOMETRIC,USE_FINGERPRINT,WAKE_LOCK,WRITE_EXTERNAL_STORAGE,io.github.hddq.restoid.DYNAMIC_RECEIVER_NOT_EXPORTED_PERMISSION</permissions><uses-permission maxSdkVersion="29" name="android.permission.READ_EXTERNAL_STORAGE"/><uses-permission maxSdkVersion="29" name="android.permission.WRITE_EXTERNAL_STORAGE"/><nativecode>x86_64</nativecode></package><package><version>0.8.1</version><versioncode>281</versioncode><apkname>app-arm64-v8a-release-v0.8.1.apk</apkname><hash type="sha256">4d723daf261970fe59947864a9bc268db73783fc8a60755c185e5cc6c597ee97</hash><size>19041859</size><sdkver>29</sdkver><targetSdkVersion>37</targetSdkVersion><added>2026-11-13</added><sig>f13c464420c712e65cc683706bcc6738</sig><permissions>ACCESS_LOCAL_NETWORK,ACCESS_NETWORK_STATE,ACCESS_WIFI_STATE,FOREGROUND_SERVICE,FOREGROUND_SERVICE_DATA_SYNC,INTERNET,MANAGE_EXTERNAL_STORAGE,POST_NOTIFICATIONS,POST_PROMOTED_NOTIFICATIONS,QUERY_ALL_PACKAGES,READ_EXTERNAL_STORAGE,RECEIVE_BOOT